  {
   "id": "text-122",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1282,
   "width": 590,
   "height": 96.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#664d00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1888375084,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1878601146,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1781802100000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2460  SHARED BUILD  (same ContentId + PackageFamilyName)\n1. FetchingContentIds reads GetPackageIdentity \u2192 PlaytestContentId + PFN of the\n   already-published packages.\n2. These become StoreAsset.ContentId + PackageFamilyName.\n3. CTIN keys asset ingestion by SourceId = StoreAsset.ContentId (set-equal by\n   construction). 4. Same ContentId \u21d2 SUCU returns the same staged versions + the\n   same store-CDN download URI \u2014 no new bytes. 5. PFN is asset metadata + PC-required.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\u2460  SHARED BUILD  (same ContentId + PackageFamilyName)\n1. FetchingContentIds reads GetPackageIdentity \u2192 PlaytestContentId + PFN of the\n   already-published packages.\n2. These become StoreAsset.ContentId + PackageFamilyName.\n3. CTIN keys asset ingestion by SourceId = StoreAsset.ContentId (set-equal by\n   construction). 4. Same ContentId \u21d2 SUCU returns the same staged versions + the\n   same store-CDN download URI \u2014 no new bytes. 5. PFN is asset metadata + PC-required.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "box-123",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 700,
   "y": 1270,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 156,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f59f00",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1341125661,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1962194050,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1781802100000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "text-124",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 716,
   "y": 1282,
   "width": 590,
   "height": 82.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#664d00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1143934659,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 831264877,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1781802100000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2461  WHERE THE BINARY GOES  (it doesn't move)\nCTIN is catalog/orchestration only \u2014 it never touches package bytes. The\nAssetIngestion job looks the asset up by SourceId and asks SUCU/XUS for changed\nversions, getting a store-CDN download URI. The bytes already live in Blob/CDN from\nthe developer's flighted publish; the PC server pulls from the store CDN.\nGRTS / Garrison / MKMS / ESRP / CMX are NOT in the streaming-ingestion path.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\u2461  WHERE THE BINARY GOES  (it doesn't move)\nCTIN is catalog/orchestration only \u2014 it never touches package bytes. The\nAssetIngestion job looks the asset up by SourceId and asks SUCU/XUS for changed\nversions, getting a store-CDN download URI. The bytes already live in Blob/CDN from\nthe developer's flighted publish; the PC server pulls from the store CDN.\nGRTS / Garrison / MKMS / ESRP / CMX are NOT in the streaming-ingestion path.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
